          "value": "The game features Frank West, the main character from the first Dead Rising game, and serves as the canon Overtime Mode of Dead Rising 2, with Frank teaming up with Chuck to further investigate the link between Phenotrans and the Fortune City zombie outbreak, and find proof that clears Chuck of any wrongdoing.\n\nThe story follows on from Ending A of the main game, with Frank rescuing Chuck from the elevator. Frank was going to meet Rebecca Chang to investigate a Phenotrans facility west of Fortune City, but learns from Chuck that she was killed by Phenotrans mole Sullivan. Although initially suspicious of Chuck because of the media reports blaming him for the Fortune City outbreak, Frank lets the motocross star come with him to find proof that Phenotrans was behind the outbreak.\n\nCase West includes cooperative play for two players, with each taking control of one of the two characters. The episode features new challenges, enemies, items, combo weapons. The photography element returns from the first Dead Rising; the characters use this to generate proof of Phenotrans' part in the zombie outbreaks.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "El juego presenta a Frank West, protagonista del primer Dead Rising, y funciona como el Modo Overtime canónico de Dead Rising 2. En él, Frank se une a Chuck para seguir investigando la relación entre Phenotrans y el brote zombi de Fortune City, y encontrar pruebas que limpien a Chuck de cualquier culpa.\n\nLa historia continúa desde el Final A del juego principal, con Frank rescatando a Chuck del ascensor. Frank iba a reunirse con Rebecca Chang para investigar una instalación de Phenotrans al oeste de Fortune City, pero Chuck le cuenta que ella fue asesinada por Sullivan, un topo de Phenotrans. Aunque al principio desconfía de Chuck por los reportajes de los medios que lo culpan del brote de Fortune City, Frank le permite acompañarlo para encontrar pruebas de que Phenotrans estaba detrás del brote.\n\nCase West incluye modo cooperativo para dos jugadores, cada uno controlando a uno de los dos personajes. El episodio presenta nuevos desafíos, enemigos, objetos y armas combinadas. El elemento de fotografía regresa del primer Dead Rising; los personajes lo usan para generar pruebas de la participación de Phenotrans en los brotes zombis.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
